#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:231
msgid ""
"The <application>pluma</application> application enables you to create and "
"edit text files."
msgstr "<application>pluma</application>應用程式讓您可以建立與編輯文字檔。"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:232
msgid ""
"The aim of <application>pluma</application> is to be a simple and easy to "
"use text editor. More powerful features can be enabled with different "
"<firstterm>plugins</firstterm>, allowing a variety of tasks related to text-"
"editing."
msgstr ""
"<application>pluma</application>的目標是成為簡單易用的文字編輯器。可以透過不"
"同的<firstterm>外掛程式</firstterm>啟用更強大的功能，讓各種與文字編輯相關的工"
"作得以進行。"

