#. (itstool) path: info/title
#: C/index.docbook:371 C/index.docbook:2092
msgid "Opening a File"
msgstr "開啟檔案"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:373
msgid ""
"To open a file, choose <menuchoice> <guimenu>File</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Open</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> to display the <guilabel>Open "
"File</guilabel> dialog. Select the file that you want to open, then click "
"<guibutton>Open</guibutton>. The file is displayed in the "
"<application>pluma</application> window."
msgstr ""
"若要開啟檔案，請選擇 <menuchoice> <guimenu>檔案</guimenu> <guimenuitem>開啟</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice>以顯示 <guilabel>開啟檔案</guilabel>對話框。選取要"
"開啟的檔案，然後按一下 <guibutton>開啟</guibutton>。檔案會顯示在 "
"<application>pluma</application>視窗中。"

#. (itstool) path: textobject/phrase
#: C/index.docbook:379
msgid "Shows Recent Files menu icon."
msgstr "顯示最近使用的檔案功能表圖示。"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: C/index.docbook:374
msgid ""
"The application records the paths and filenames of the five most recent "
"files that you edited and displays the files as menu items on the "
"<menuchoice> <guimenu>File</guimenu> </menuchoice> menu. You can also click "
"on the <_:inlinemediaobject-1/> icon on the toolbar to display the list of "
"recent files."
msgstr ""
"應用程式會記錄您最近編輯的五個檔案的路徑與檔名，並在 <menuchoice> <guimenu>檔"
"案</guimenu> </menuchoice>功能表上以功能表項目顯示這些檔案。您也可以按一下工"
"具列上的 <_:inlinemediaobject-1/> 圖示，顯示最近使用的檔案清單。"

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: C/index.docbook:383
msgid ""
"You can open multiple files in <application>pluma</application>. The "
"application adds a tab for each open file to the window. For more on this "
"see <xref linkend=\"pluma-tabs\"/>."
msgstr ""
"您可以在 <application>pluma</application>中開啟多個檔案。應用程式會在視窗中為"
"每個開啟的檔案新增分頁。詳細資訊請參閱 <xref linkend=\"pluma-tabs\"/>。"

